  "description": "This makes 12 servings and each serving has: 356.01 Calories, 26.48g Fat, 4.84g Net Carbs, 22.17g Protein This dish is a little high on the carb side, but one serving is very filling. I only used 6 1/2 tortillas, so actual macros are slightly lower. If you are using pre-cooked chicken, you can deduct the additional 1 Tbs butter from macros.",
  "servings": 12,
  "yield": [
    "12"
  ],
  "prepTime": "PT10M",
  "cookTime": "PT50M",
  "totalTime": "PT60M",
  "totalMinutes": 60,
  "nutrition": {
    "@type": "NutritionInformation",
    "calories": "356.01 kcal",
